- Commands run this round: read-only only — a static import/export cross-check (which caught and fixed a reintroduced wrong import depth in `event-projection.ts`), `node --check` on the two `.mjs` files, `sha256sum`, `git status`/`diff`. No `find /`, no cross-drive traversal, no provider/credential change, no subagents.
- `HANDOFF.md` updated: a "Round 3 — the REVIEW-2 fixes" section per finding, the new 33-file SHA256 table (verified against the files), the corrected test table, and the remaining NOT_RUN/limitations. Original logs preserved byte-identical (`claude-A.stdout.log`, `claude-A.stderr.log`, `claude-A-review1.*`, `claude-A-review2.*`).
